@startuml PasswordEntry_Lifecycle_State_Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor<<active>> LightGreen
    BackgroundColor<<warning>> Yellow
    BackgroundColor<<expired>> LightCoral
    BackgroundColor<<deleted>> Gray
    BorderColor Black
    FontSize 12
    FontStyle bold
}

title Diagramma Stati - Ciclo di Vita Password Entry

[*] --> Created : User aggiunge entry\n(VaultService.addEntry)

state Created <<active>> {
    state "Entry Creata" as created_state
    created_state : **Campi**:
    created_state : • id: UUID (generato)
    created_state : • serviceName: String
    created_state : • username: String
    created_state : • encryptedPassword: byte[]
    created_state : • createdAt: LocalDateTime.now()
    created_state : • expiresAt: LocalDateTime? (opzionale)
    created_state : • user: UserEntity (FK)
    created_state : ----
    created_state : **Stato**: Cifrata con AES-256-CBC
    created_state : **Persistenza**: Salvata in DB
}

Created --> Active : Nessuna scadenza\n(expiresAt == null)

state Active <<active>> {
    state "Password Attiva" as active_state
    active_state : **Condizioni**:
    active_state : • expiresAt == null OR
    active_state : • LocalDateTime.now() < expiresAt
    active_state : ----
    active_state : **Operazioni Permesse**:
    active_state : ✓ Lettura (decifratura)
    active_state : ✓ Modifica
    active_state : ✓ Eliminazione
    active_state : ✓ Copia clipboard
    active_state : ----
    active_state : **Audit Check**:
    active_state : • Robustezza password
    active_state : • Età password
    active_state : • Riutilizzo password
}

Created --> Expiring : Scadenza impostata\n(expiresAt != null)

state Expiring <<warning>> {
    state "In Scadenza" as expiring_state
    expiring_state : **Condizioni**:
    expiring_state : • expiresAt != null
    expiring_state : • LocalDateTime.now() < expiresAt
    expiring_state : • (expiresAt - now) <= 30 giorni
    expiring_state : ----
    expiring_state : **Warnings**:
    expiring_state : ⚠️ Password in scadenza
    expiring_state : ⚠️ Audit score ridotto
    expiring_state : ----
    expiring_state : **UI**: Badge "Scadenza vicina"
}

Expiring --> Expired : LocalDateTime.now() >= expiresAt

state Expired <<expired>> {
    state "Password Scaduta" as expired_state
    expired_state : **Condizioni**:
    expired_state : • expiresAt != null
    expired_state : • LocalDateTime.now() >= expiresAt
    expired_state : ----
    expired_state : **Operazioni**:
    expired_state : ✗ Lettura bloccata
    expired_state : ✓ Eliminazione permessa
    expired_state : ✓ Rinnovo (update expiresAt)
    expired_state : ----
    expired_state : **UI**: Badge rosso "SCADUTA"
    expired_state : **Audit**: Penalizzazione health score
}

Expired --> Active : User rinnova password\n(update expiresAt)
Active --> Modified : User modifica entry\n(VaultService.updateEntry)

state Modified <<active>> {
    state "Entry Modificata" as modified_state
    modified_state : **Campi Aggiornati**:
    modified_state : • serviceName (opzionale)
    modified_state : • username (opzionale)
    modified_state : • encryptedPassword (se pwd cambiata)
    modified_state : • expiresAt (opzionale)
    modified_state : ----
    modified_state : **Nota**: createdAt NON cambia
    modified_state : **Audit**: Ri-valutazione robustezza
}

Modified --> Active : Salvataggio completato

Active --> Deleted : User elimina entry\n(VaultService.deleteEntry)
Expiring --> Deleted : User elimina entry
Expired --> Deleted : User elimina entry
Modified --> Deleted : User elimina entry

state Deleted <<deleted>> {
    state "Entry Eliminata" as deleted_state
    deleted_state : **Azioni**:
    deleted_state : 1. Sovrascrizione dati sensibili
    deleted_state :    (encryptedPassword = zeros)
    deleted_state : 2. Flush database forzato
    deleted_state : 3. Eliminazione fisica record
    deleted_state : 4. Notifica observers (UI refresh)
    deleted_state : ----
    deleted_state : **Sicurezza**: Data sanitization
    deleted_state : **Recovery**: NON possibile (design choice)
}

Deleted --> [*]

note right of Active
    **SecurityAudit** controlla:
    • Età > 365 giorni → Password VECCHIA
    • Riutilizzo → Password DUPLICATA
    • Robustezza < MEDIUM → Password DEBOLE

    Health Score: 100 - (vecchie + duplicati + deboli)
end note

note left of Expired
    **Cleanup automatico**:
    Job schedulato elimina entry scadute
    dopo 90 giorni (configurabile)

    **Implementazione futura**
end note

note bottom of Deleted
    **Pattern**: Secure Deletion
    • DoD 5220.22-M compliant
    • Previene data recovery
    • GDPR Art. 17 compliant
end note

@enduml

